{"1768650": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Path of the Abyss", "steam_appid": 1768650, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Path of the Abyss is a single-player, grid-based dungeon exploration RPG.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You explore dungeons expressed in black-and-white pen drawings with your freely customized character and aim for the deepest level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1768650/extras/66bcee511afb3770444bb8feeaaca424.poster.avif?t=1749827090\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1768650/extras/66bcee511afb3770444bb8feeaaca424.webm?t=1749827090\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1768650/extras/66bcee511afb3770444bb8feeaaca424.mp4?t=1749827090\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >*Unique Features* </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・First person RPG</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・Real-time Combat that can be paused at any moment</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・Diverse Character Builds</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・Many mysteries and loot to be uncovered in dungeons</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >*Combat*</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat operates in real time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can pause at any time so analyze your enemy’s attacks, buff your allies, intercept enemy attacks and deploy a wide range of tactics to gain an advantage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will be able to see what the enemy intends on doing. It is important to react with the appropriate skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Basically, you want to…</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. Pause and see how the enemy intends to attack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. Choose the appropriate skills. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3. Unpause.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat will be done by repeating these steps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skills you want to use in combat will be set into the “Formation Panel” formed by 9 panels, prior to combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The outcome of combat will be affected greatly by the skills and the position of the skills you place on the Formation Panel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Formation Panel will be shared by the party, a unique feature of this game is to come up with ways to use the limited number panels you have.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1768650/extras/bc49b1983e22e63c84ef5b9974a24a66.poster.avif?t=1749827090\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1768650/extras/bc49b1983e22e63c84ef5b9974a24a66.webm?t=1749827090\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1768650/extras/bc49b1983e22e63c84ef5b9974a24a66.mp4?t=1749827090\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >*Character Builds*</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can build a character by customizing 8 abilities, 5 basic stats, skills and gear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >*Party Build*</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You build the party by setting up skills of the characters into the Formation Panel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some skills have synergistic effects, and the Formation Panel should be set up so that the skills complement each other.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >*Exploration*</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Path of the Abyss, you explore a world comprised by one giant dungeon and several minor dungeons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the mysteries of the dungeons, strengthen your characters and make it to the the deepest depths of the dungeon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >*Story*</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A small ruin in East Weltden.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a forgotten ruin that has been robbed countless times, sightings of terrifying monsters became frequent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some scoffed at the sightings as mere rumors, and ventured into the ruins to boast of their intrepidity, only to never return.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Lord of East Weltden dispatched an investigation team but it only resulted in a bloodbath.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rumors of this ruin traveled far and wide, luring skilled adventurers to the land.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are such an adventurer yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >*Video uploads/Streaming*</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please post the URL of the Steam page for Path of the Abyss in the description.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feel free to monetize.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Path of the Abyss is a single-player, grid-based dungeon exploration RPG.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You explore dungeons expressed in black-and-white pen drawings with your freely customized character and aim for the deepest level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1768650/extras/66bcee511afb3770444bb8feeaaca424.poster.avif?t=1749827090\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1768650/extras/66bcee511afb3770444bb8feeaaca424.webm?t=1749827090\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src