team/apps/1768650/extras/bc49b1983e22e63c84ef5b9974a24a66.poster.avif?t=1749827090\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1768650/extras/bc49b1983e22e63c84ef5b9974a24a66.webm?t=1749827090\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1768650/extras/bc49b1983e22e63c84ef5b9974a24a66.mp4?t=1749827090\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >*Character Builds*</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can build a character by customizing 8 abilities, 5 basic stats, skills and gear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >*Party Build*</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You build the party by setting up skills of the characters into the Formation Panel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some skills have synergistic effects, and the Formation Panel should be set up so that the skills complement each other.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >*Exploration*</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Path of the Abyss, you explore a world comprised by one giant dungeon and several minor dungeons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the mysteries of the dungeons, strengthen your characters and make it to the the deepest depths of the dungeon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >*Story*</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A small ruin in East Weltden.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a forgotten ruin that has been robbed countless times, sightings of terrifying monsters became frequent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some scoffed at the sightings as mere rumors, and ventured into the ruins to boast of their intrepidity, only to never return.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Lord of East Weltden dispatched an investigation team but it only resulted in a bloodbath.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rumors of this ruin traveled far and wide, luring skilled adventurers to 